WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:04.030
<b>You had another daughter.</b>

00:04.470 --> 00:07.410
<b>Where is Ericht Samaya now?</b>

00:07.410 --> 00:08.450
<b>She's there.</b>

00:09.560 --> 00:11.530
<b>Right at Suletta's side.</b>

00:12.350 --> 00:14.700
<b>Beyond the data storm...</b>

00:14.700 --> 00:16.990
<b>she's there waiting for us.</b>

00:18.610 --> 00:20.280
<b>It can't be...</b>

00:20.280 --> 00:23.710
<b>you turned a human into a mobile suit...</b>

00:24.360 --> 00:25.960
<b>I want to rewrite the world.</b>

00:26.870 --> 00:29.480
<b>So that Eri can be happy.</b>

00:30.950 --> 00:33.430
<b>I couldn't believe my eyes at first.</b>

00:33.430 --> 00:38.180
<b>Eri's biometric code was completely
synched with the data storm.</b>

00:38.840 --> 00:40.210
<b>Even so...</b>

00:40.210 --> 00:44.310
<b>her child's body couldn't endure
the harshness of outer space.</b>

00:44.930 --> 00:49.290
<b>I decided to use Lfrith to keep Eri alive.</b>

00:49.720 --> 00:51.650
<b>Alive as Aerial.</b>

00:52.600 --> 00:58.210
<b>You used the data storm's network to
transfer her biometric code, is that it?</b>

00:58.560 --> 01:01.450
<b>Eri is nothing more than
Permet particles now.</b>

01:02.360 --> 01:07.500
<b>Without Aerial as her body,
she'd disintegrate in physical space.</b>

01:08.110 --> 01:10.800
<b>But with a Permet score of eight...</b>

01:11.290 --> 01:15.930
<b>If we can expand the range of
the data storm through Quiet Zero...</b>

01:16.420 --> 01:18.010
<b>Then Eri...</b>

01:18.010 --> 01:20.780
<b>can live in freedom!</b>

01:22.340 --> 01:23.930
<b>Won't you help me?</b>

01:24.550 --> 01:26.190
<b>Bel?</b>

01:28.340 --> 01:29.230
<b>I can't.</b>

01:30.510 --> 01:31.910
<b>Oh?</b>

01:31.910 --> 01:32.820
<b>Why is that?</b>

01:33.310 --> 01:36.850
<b>These aren't the principles
of the Vanadis Institute.</b>

01:36.850 --> 01:39.500
<b>But didn't you make enhanced humans?</b>

01:40.380 --> 01:43.420
<b>Using an artificial central nervous system
with resistance to the data storm.</b>

01:43.420 --> 01:45.290
<b>That's the Neural Expansion Theory.</b>

01:45.880 --> 01:49.600
<b>Dr. Cardo refused to accept it.</b>

01:50.320 --> 01:50.960
<b>Don't...</b>

01:51.460 --> 01:53.810
<b>The one who conceived the idea...</b>

01:53.810 --> 01:55.770
<b>was you, am I right?</b>

01:54.120 --> 01:55.400
<b>Stop it!</b>

01:58.960 --> 02:00.140
<b>Say no more...</b>

02:01.130 --> 02:02.610
<b>Please.</b>

02:02.610 --> 02:04.390
<b>There will be no escape...</b>

02:05.130 --> 02:06.390
<b>for you, either.</b>

03:39.640 --> 03:43.440
<b>The terrorist attack at the Asticassia
School of Technology</b>

03:43.440 --> 03:46.990
<b>has now, with the kidnapping
of Grassley's Sarius Zenelli...</b>

03:46.990 --> 03:49.950
<b>The group claiming responsibility,
the Dawn of Fold,</b>

03:49.950 --> 03:53.580
<b>is also said to be involved in
the recent accident at Plant Quetta...</b>

03:53.580 --> 03:57.130
<b>Jeturk CEO Vim Jeturk
has been reported dead.</b>

03:57.620 --> 04:02.130
<b>According to some sources, the Group's
President, Delling Rembran, is injured as well.</b>

04:02.620 --> 04:06.220
<b>With the Benerit Group carrying out
security operations at its own discretion</b>

04:06.220 --> 04:07.890
<b>under business administrative laws,</b>

04:07.890 --> 04:13.910
<b>growing anti-Spacian sentiment on Earth
has escalated many protests into riots.</b>

04:15.680 --> 04:19.830
<b>The Group has been heavily
criticized for its recent actions</b>

04:19.830 --> 04:20.730
<b>and a swift response--</b>

04:21.520 --> 04:24.870
<b>It seems our confidential matters
have been leaked.</b>

04:24.870 --> 04:27.290
<b>Any clue where Sarius Zenelli is?</b>

04:27.290 --> 04:30.460
<b>Nothing but the single
video message he sent.</b>

04:30.460 --> 04:32.910
<b>The front management company
is continuing the search.</b>

04:33.400 --> 04:35.810
<b>What is Cathedra doing?</b>

04:35.810 --> 04:38.680
<b>After two attacks,
they still can't catch them?</b>

04:38.680 --> 04:42.440
<b>Weren't you also there
during the Open Campus incident?</b>

04:42.800 --> 04:45.940
<b>All these hardline policies
have backfired.</b>

04:45.940 --> 04:49.790
<b>The Space Assembly League
is starting to dig around too.</b>

04:49.790 --> 04:51.310
<b>At this rate...</b>

04:51.960 --> 04:53.500
<b>Yes.</b>

04:53.500 --> 04:57.620
<b>We'll have no choice
but to elect a new president.</b>

04:58.270 --> 05:00.280
<b>It's just as we predicted.</b>

05:00.280 --> 05:01.980
<b>You'll run in the election, right?</b>

05:02.250 --> 05:04.320
<b>I don't intend to miss this chance.</b>

05:04.540 --> 05:08.950
<b>Isn't Miss Miorine going to
take over for President Delling?</b>

05:08.950 --> 05:11.950
<b>Blood alone isn't enough
to put you at the top.</b>

05:12.180 --> 05:16.330
<b>Let's see. If she had backing
from one of the three branches,</b>

05:16.330 --> 05:16.740
<b>she could--</b>

05:16.740 --> 05:17.530
<b>Shaddiq.</b>

05:18.380 --> 05:22.270
<b>I won't try to be her partner anymore.
I'm going to the head office.</b>

05:22.270 --> 05:23.980
<b>Everyone's waiting.</b>

05:27.930 --> 05:31.430
<b>So GUND-ARM, Inc.
has been cleared of suspicion?</b>

05:31.430 --> 05:34.750
<b>We've found no evidence of your
involvement, that's all.</b>

05:34.750 --> 05:37.200
<b>I see. Too bad for you.</b>

05:37.550 --> 05:39.690
<b>We're going to choose a new president.</b>

05:40.380 --> 05:41.750
<b>You should be happy.</b>

05:41.750 --> 05:44.820
<b>Now you won't be a trophy
in the dueling game.</b>

05:45.610 --> 05:46.950
<b>I couldn't care less...</b>

05:47.640 --> 05:48.820
<b>about all of that.</b>

05:49.510 --> 05:52.830
<b>Episode 16</b>

06:08.710 --> 06:12.430
<b>The front is currently
under a state of emergency.</b>

06:12.880 --> 06:15.450
<b>In accordance with school
emergency regulations,</b>

06:15.450 --> 06:18.520
<b>all students are currently
subject to activity restrictions.</b>

06:18.970 --> 06:20.940
<b>There are fewer students.</b>

06:18.970 --> 06:20.940
<b>Restricted activities can be...</b>

06:20.940 --> 06:23.620
<b>Can't blame those who left.</b>

06:21.810 --> 06:23.620
<b>The Space Assembly League was...</b>

06:23.620 --> 06:26.170
<b>My parents are picking me up next week.</b>

06:23.620 --> 06:26.690
<b>...created to settle disputes...</b>

06:27.190 --> 06:28.990
<b>Aren't you taking time off school, Rouji?</b>

06:29.440 --> 06:32.440
<b>What about you, Secelia?</b>

06:32.440 --> 06:35.370
<b>If I leave too, no one can hold any duels.</b>

06:35.860 --> 06:37.910
<b>So you do have a sense of duty.</b>

06:37.910 --> 06:40.920
<b>It's almost the Princess's birthday, right?</b>

06:41.610 --> 06:46.100
<b>At least I should be here
to see who becomes her groom.</b>

06:47.250 --> 06:48.760
<b>Out of the way, Suletta!</b>

06:48.760 --> 06:52.820
<b>Just how long do they have
to keep Nika in custody?!</b>

06:52.820 --> 06:54.390
<b>You can't take that wrench!</b>

06:54.390 --> 06:56.860
<b>We're all suspended already.</b>

06:56.860 --> 06:58.530
<b>Don't cause any more trouble.</b>

06:58.530 --> 07:00.780
<b>Didn't they say they're
still investigating?</b>

07:00.780 --> 07:02.000
<b>But it's been five days!</b>

07:02.000 --> 07:06.540
<b>They're always suspicious
of us Earthians, that's all.</b>

07:06.540 --> 07:07.570
<b>Yeah, but even so,</b>

07:08.020 --> 07:11.700
<b>why'd they have to confiscate
Aerial and my own Demi too?</b>

07:11.700 --> 07:14.050
<b>Suletta's putting up with it, isn't she?</b>

07:14.050 --> 07:16.340
<b>Just two more days and our suspension--</b>

07:18.400 --> 07:19.620
<b>You jerks...</b>

07:20.450 --> 07:21.830
<b>What are you doing?</b>

07:21.830 --> 07:24.220
<b>Get out, terrorists!</b>

07:24.220 --> 07:27.300
<b>You guys brought the Gundams
that attacked us, didn't you?</b>

07:27.930 --> 07:29.580
<b>Get real!</b>

07:29.580 --> 07:32.820
<b>None of us knew anything
about Sophie and the other girl!</b>

07:32.820 --> 07:36.150
<b>So quit harassing us, will you?!</b>

07:36.500 --> 07:38.560
<b>You're protecting your fellow witches.</b>

07:38.960 --> 07:40.050
<b>Witches?</b>

07:40.050 --> 07:41.910
<b>Our company staff said so.</b>

07:42.260 --> 07:47.070
<b>The witches who made the Gundams
took pilots' lives with their experiments.</b>

07:47.070 --> 07:49.570
<b>O-Our Gundam isn't like that--</b>

07:49.570 --> 07:51.860
<b>You took lives too! In the Rumble Ring!</b>

07:55.190 --> 07:58.290
<b>Jubeju was... a precious friend to us!</b>

07:58.290 --> 07:59.870
<b>But you...</b>

07:59.870 --> 08:01.460
<b>Give us back Jubeju!</b>

08:01.910 --> 08:02.790
<b>Murderers!</b>

08:07.530 --> 08:08.160
<b>Martin...</b>

08:08.160 --> 08:09.170
<b>Mr. Martin!</b>

08:09.170 --> 08:11.900
<b>You creeps are gonna pay for that!</b>

08:11.900 --> 08:13.430
<b>Stop it, all of you!</b>

08:17.130 --> 08:19.530
<b>Ms... Miorine?</b>

08:19.530 --> 08:24.240
<b>I don't think the school will
ignore direct evidence of assault.</b>

08:25.970 --> 08:30.160
<b>Thank you very much...
for treating my injuries.</b>

08:30.680 --> 08:32.040
<b>Nika Nanaura.</b>

08:33.270 --> 08:35.450
<b>Don't you want to join our group?</b>

08:35.450 --> 08:36.590
<b>What?</b>

08:36.590 --> 08:38.440
<b>I've been watching you.</b>

08:38.440 --> 08:41.800
<b>Your skill as a mechanic,
and your behavior on campus...</b>

08:42.490 --> 08:45.870
<b>If you're with us, you can
continue your studies elsewhere.</b>

08:47.100 --> 08:50.850
<b>You could even achieve your dream
of bridging Earth and Space.</b>

08:51.580 --> 08:53.580
<b>I've made a decision.</b>

08:53.580 --> 08:56.140
<b>I shouldn't act like a victim anymore.</b>

08:56.870 --> 09:00.560
<b>Even if the ends are just,
I don't want to use the wrong means.</b>

09:01.300 --> 09:03.280
<b>Even if it's for Earth's sake?</b>

09:03.280 --> 09:05.660
<b>Are you an Earthian too?</b>

09:06.190 --> 09:08.410
<b>I was until Grassley took me in.</b>

09:09.800 --> 09:12.160
<b>Ideals alone can't change reality</b>

09:12.520 --> 09:13.990
<b>You can't leave here either.</b>

09:15.180 --> 09:17.200
<b>But Shaddiq and I will make it happen.</b>

09:18.020 --> 09:20.760
<b>The dream of bridging Earth and Space...</b>

09:22.480 --> 09:24.290
<b>I'll cut right to the chase.</b>

09:24.810 --> 09:27.370
<b>Obtain the Aerial for us.</b>

09:27.370 --> 09:30.640
<b>And what about winning over Suletta Mercury?</b>

09:30.640 --> 09:32.600
<b>The presidential race is beginning.</b>

09:32.600 --> 09:34.770
<b>The dueling game is over.</b>

09:34.770 --> 09:35.770
<b>Plus...</b>

09:35.770 --> 09:39.360
<b>your lackadaisical fighting
during the Rumble Ring</b>

09:39.360 --> 09:41.780
<b>has left us rather disappointed.</b>

09:41.780 --> 09:44.640
<b>I was merely observing the situation.</b>

09:44.640 --> 09:49.100
<b>The Aerial has been temporarily confiscated
because of the recent incident.</b>

09:49.560 --> 09:52.790
<b>If you want to live,
carry out your mission at all costs.</b>

09:54.690 --> 09:56.530
<b>Benerit Group Front</b>

09:55.480 --> 09:56.530
<b>What's the latest?</b>

09:56.530 --> 10:00.230
<b>The company has split into six factions.</b>

10:00.230 --> 10:02.030
<b>We're in sixth place?</b>

10:02.030 --> 10:04.180
<b>We'll be number one soon enough.</b>

10:04.180 --> 10:05.800
<b>That's the plan.</b>

10:14.580 --> 10:16.210
<b>It feels like...</b>

10:16.210 --> 10:18.270
<b>I've been gone for ages.</b>

10:24.130 --> 10:25.720
<b>Lauda, Petra...</b>

10:28.220 --> 10:29.440
<b>How've you been?</b>

10:30.180 --> 10:31.660
<b>Mr. Guel?</b>

10:32.930 --> 10:35.290
<b>Brother! Brother, you're...</b>

10:35.290 --> 10:36.490
<b>Mr. Lauda!</b>

10:36.490 --> 10:37.380
<b>Lauda!</b>

10:40.320 --> 10:42.370
<b>I think he's just relieved.</b>

10:43.150 --> 10:47.950
<b>After you disappeared, Mr. Guel,
and then that terrible event happened...</b>

10:48.740 --> 10:52.400
<b>Mr. Lauda suddenly had
to take over the company.</b>

10:52.400 --> 10:58.060
<b>The Group has kept pressing him to give
explanations, take responsibility...</b>

10:58.570 --> 11:00.500
<b>Oh... forgive me.</b>

11:00.500 --> 11:02.230
<b>Your father...</b>

11:03.890 --> 11:06.010
<b>Yeah. I'm aware.</b>

11:07.920 --> 11:11.340
<b>Mr. Lauda didn't even have time to grieve.</b>

11:11.340 --> 11:13.060
<b>He's been struggling all alone.</b>

11:14.010 --> 11:15.250
<b>That's why...</b>

11:16.510 --> 11:17.360
<b>Petra.</b>

11:17.860 --> 11:19.250
<b>Take care of Lauda.</b>

11:21.100 --> 11:22.710
<b>I'll handle the rest.</b>

11:24.270 --> 11:25.860
<b>Mr. Guel!</b>

11:29.150 --> 11:30.580
<b>Welcome back.</b>

11:34.330 --> 11:39.010
<b>We couldn't find any record of the
front management company's involvement.</b>

11:39.010 --> 11:40.730
<b>What do you mean?</b>

11:40.730 --> 11:45.640
<b>Nika Nanaura was taken by other parties
disguised as front management employees.</b>

11:46.170 --> 11:48.490
<b>Can you confirm the departure list?</b>

11:48.490 --> 11:50.320
<b>Of course!</b>

11:50.320 --> 11:53.400
<b>But in return, will you grant me a favor?</b>

11:54.640 --> 11:58.530
<b>I'd like a pass to freely
enter and exit GUND-ARM, Inc.</b>

11:58.530 --> 12:00.910
<b>You want to investigate our company too?</b>

12:00.910 --> 12:06.360
<b>I'm curious about the Shin Sei
Development Corporation you acquired.</b>

12:06.360 --> 12:08.690
<b>If you inform me of what you find...</b>

12:11.030 --> 12:12.530
<b>You're going directly?</b>

12:12.530 --> 12:15.710
<b>The costs for their Gundam repair
were excessive,</b>

12:15.710 --> 12:18.300
<b>and a lot of equipment
was sent to Plant Quetta...</b>

12:18.840 --> 12:21.600
<b>Is that appropriate
for a bottom-ranked company?</b>

12:22.020 --> 12:23.840
<b>Is the Group behind this?</b>

12:25.290 --> 12:27.440
<b>Even if it requires groundless accusations,</b>

12:27.440 --> 12:30.530
<b>the higher-ups plan to forcibly
intervene in the Benerit Group.</b>

12:30.880 --> 12:33.230
<b>We have to prevent unnecessary fuss.</b>

12:33.760 --> 12:36.810
<b>It's our role as mediators.</b>

12:37.390 --> 12:38.750
<b>What did you find out?</b>

12:38.750 --> 12:40.850
<b>Nika isn't with
the front management company.</b>

12:40.850 --> 12:42.170
<b>What?!</b>

12:42.560 --> 12:44.900
<b>So where is she, then?</b>

12:44.900 --> 12:47.010
<b>They're looking into it for me.</b>

12:47.010 --> 12:48.160
<b>Wait until I hear back.</b>

12:48.160 --> 12:49.270
<b>But--</b>

12:49.270 --> 12:50.630
<b>Understood.</b>

12:51.530 --> 12:53.970
<b>We couldn't find out anything on our own.</b>

12:54.350 --> 12:55.870
<b>So... you know...</b>

12:57.160 --> 12:58.430
<b>Thanks.</b>

13:04.660 --> 13:06.440
<b>You're welcome.</b>

13:06.440 --> 13:08.510
<b>Meanwhile, here you are.</b>

13:09.030 --> 13:09.550
<b>Huh?</b>

13:09.550 --> 13:12.160
<b>The company's suspended
from doing business,</b>

13:12.160 --> 13:14.180
<b>but we're still incurring
maintenance costs.</b>

13:14.180 --> 13:16.880
<b>Please authorize these payments as well.</b>

13:16.880 --> 13:18.900
<b>And please look over these notifications!</b>

13:18.900 --> 13:21.370
<b>I'd like to buy a new app.</b>

13:21.370 --> 13:25.080
<b>I...I, uh...</b>

13:26.480 --> 13:27.350
<b>Over here!</b>

13:27.350 --> 13:28.200
<b>Huh?</b>

13:31.520 --> 13:33.040
<b>Uh, well, I...</b>

13:33.040 --> 13:36.200
<b>I'd like you... to look...</b>

13:36.200 --> 13:38.470
<b>at the greenhouse.</b>

13:43.620 --> 13:46.050
<b>Lilique! Organize the materials
for me to check.</b>

13:46.290 --> 13:47.320
<b>Right!</b>

13:52.670 --> 13:53.840
<b>Aren't you coming?</b>

13:54.860 --> 13:56.280
<b>Y-Yes!</b>

13:56.840 --> 13:58.810
<b>Hello!</b>

13:58.810 --> 14:01.060
<b>Is there anyone home?</b>

14:01.970 --> 14:03.000
<b>Who's that?</b>

14:03.000 --> 14:04.000
<b>Mom?</b>

14:04.000 --> 14:04.960
<b>"Mom"?!</b>

14:04.960 --> 14:05.790
<b>What?!</b>

14:07.020 --> 14:08.670
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

14:08.670 --> 14:11.380
<b>The investigators finished questioning me.</b>

14:11.380 --> 14:14.340
<b>I hadn't seen you at all
since the incident, right?</b>

14:14.340 --> 14:16.790
<b>I see. I'll show you around, then.</b>

14:17.220 --> 14:19.420
<b>Don't worry. I can get around by myself.</b>

14:19.420 --> 14:20.450
<b>But...</b>

14:20.450 --> 14:22.460
<b>You're going out with Ms. Miorine, right?</b>

14:22.990 --> 14:25.310
<b>You should look after your bride.</b>

14:25.910 --> 14:28.270
<b>Yeah! You're right!</b>

14:31.420 --> 14:32.530
<b>Let's go.</b>

14:32.530 --> 14:34.070
<b>O-Okay!</b>

14:34.070 --> 14:35.490
<b>We'll be back!</b>

14:35.490 --> 14:36.860
<b>Have fun!</b>

14:38.590 --> 14:42.660
<b>How nice to meet you all.
I'm Suletta's mother.</b>

14:46.860 --> 14:49.200
<b>Sorry about this, Suletta Mercury...</b>

14:49.200 --> 14:52.050
<b>But I'm stealing your family member.</b>

14:54.200 --> 14:55.460
<b>No response...</b>

14:56.240 --> 14:58.200
<b>Wasn't Number Four able to use it?</b>

15:10.460 --> 15:12.620
<b>A data storm...</b>

15:12.620 --> 15:14.440
<b>Why, all of a sudden...</b>

15:14.920 --> 15:16.160
<b>Stay away.</b>

15:25.130 --> 15:26.860
<b>Suletta...</b>

15:27.810 --> 15:29.170
<b>Mercury?</b>

15:37.400 --> 15:39.620
<b>You can't come here.</b>

15:40.860 --> 15:42.040
<b>No...</b>

15:43.500 --> 15:45.210
<b>Who are you people?</b>

16:01.630 --> 16:04.900
<b>What the heck... is this Gundam?</b>

16:05.470 --> 16:08.040
<b>This isn't like the Pharact at all!</b>

16:09.430 --> 16:11.670
<b>You're unable to handle it.</b>

16:17.860 --> 16:20.050
<b>This is an order from above.</b>

16:20.050 --> 16:21.840
<b>You should help, too.</b>

16:22.820 --> 16:23.920
<b>I can't.</b>

16:24.460 --> 16:29.100
<b>It must be easier tinkering with this
than with enhanced humans.</b>

16:30.110 --> 16:32.510
<b>What should I have done instead?</b>

16:32.510 --> 16:33.980
<b>Huh?</b>

16:33.980 --> 16:36.570
<b>After my colleagues and research
went up in flames,</b>

16:36.920 --> 16:39.850
<b>I had to take refuge on Peil's payroll.</b>

16:40.420 --> 16:44.700
<b>But one day... GUND's ideals
would lead to a better future--</b>

16:46.260 --> 16:48.480
<b>Even for human experiments like me?</b>

16:49.350 --> 16:51.080
<b>You don't want to die yourself,</b>

16:51.080 --> 16:54.030
<b>but you don't give a damn about my future!</b>

16:54.030 --> 16:54.980
<b>You're wrong, I--</b>

16:54.980 --> 16:56.070
<b>Like hell I'm wrong!</b>

16:57.310 --> 17:00.010
<b>I'm going to report you to the higher-ups.</b>

17:10.830 --> 17:12.750
<b>I did as you said</b>

17:12.750 --> 17:14.530
<b>and used the Andes model.</b>

17:14.530 --> 17:15.090
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:15.530 --> 17:17.630
<b>Did you get my emails?</b>

17:17.630 --> 17:19.890
<b>I did. Three a day.</b>

17:20.360 --> 17:22.280
<b>And I haven't lost any duels.</b>

17:22.280 --> 17:23.810
<b>I can tell from your uniform.</b>

17:26.010 --> 17:28.120
<b>Are you mad at me, Ms. Miorine?</b>

17:28.470 --> 17:29.090
<b>Eh?</b>

17:30.010 --> 17:32.710
<b>About what happened at the plant...</b>

17:35.310 --> 17:37.660
<b>No, you should be mad at me.</b>

17:38.080 --> 17:38.780
<b>Huh?</b>

17:39.460 --> 17:42.470
<b>You saved my life and my father's.</b>

17:42.940 --> 17:45.540
<b>And yet, I said something awful to you.</b>

17:47.110 --> 17:48.920
<b>I wanted to say I was sorry...</b>

17:49.660 --> 17:51.890
<b>I should have thanked you.</b>

17:55.500 --> 17:56.690
<b>I knew it.</b>

17:56.690 --> 17:58.560
<b>It's just like Mom said.</b>

17:59.920 --> 18:02.650
<b>She told me that you'd
understand eventually.</b>

18:03.210 --> 18:06.450
<b>That Aerial and I did the right thing.</b>

18:07.050 --> 18:08.650
<b>The right thing?</b>

18:08.650 --> 18:12.680
<b>Yes! Run and gain one.
Move forward and gain two!</b>

18:12.680 --> 18:14.870
<b>Because I fought without running away,</b>

18:14.870 --> 18:18.920
<b>I was able to protect you
and all of Earth House!</b>

18:22.690 --> 18:24.650
<b>How can you smile like that?</b>

18:24.650 --> 18:25.500
<b>Huh?</b>

18:26.360 --> 18:28.760
<b>I know you rescued me.</b>

18:29.200 --> 18:31.670
<b>But... you smashed...</b>

18:31.670 --> 18:33.770
<b>smashed another person to death...</b>

18:34.460 --> 18:36.560
<b>I can't smile!</b>

18:36.560 --> 18:39.050
<b>Right thing or not,
you shouldn't smile about it!</b>

18:39.050 --> 18:43.360
<b>What? B-But only the two of us
could save everyone.</b>

18:43.360 --> 18:45.360
<b>Is that what your mom told you?</b>

18:45.710 --> 18:46.560
<b>Yes.</b>

18:46.560 --> 18:50.060
<b>Will you do anything
your mom tells you to?</b>

18:50.060 --> 18:52.290
<b>I wouldn't say "anything"...</b>

18:52.290 --> 18:56.120
<b>What if she told you to give up your dream
of building a school at Mercury?</b>

18:56.570 --> 19:00.010
<b>I'd be troubled... I guess...</b>

19:01.230 --> 19:02.410
<b>But...</b>

19:02.410 --> 19:05.700
<b>But if my mom told me to, I'd give up.</b>

19:08.030 --> 19:11.830
<b>GUND-ARM, Inc. isn't a tool of war!</b>

19:11.830 --> 19:16.420
<b>Didn't we all decide we'd build Gundams
that can save lives through medicine?!</b>

19:16.420 --> 19:20.900
<b>If your mother told you to,
would you use Gundams to kill people?</b>

19:31.720 --> 19:32.810
<b>Yes.</b>

19:33.680 --> 19:35.480
<b>If Mom told me to.</b>

19:35.950 --> 19:39.790
<b>It's because I did what Mom said,
that I got to go to school.</b>

19:39.790 --> 19:41.380
<b>And make friends.</b>

19:41.730 --> 19:43.780
<b>And meet you, Ms. Miorine...</b>

19:44.400 --> 19:47.580
<b>So I know my mom is always right.</b>

19:53.570 --> 19:55.140
<b>Ms. Miorine?</b>

20:02.000 --> 20:03.800
<b>Just a little longer...</b>

20:03.800 --> 20:05.780
<b>Wait for me, Eri.</b>

20:06.170 --> 20:07.510
<b>Prospera!</b>

20:09.680 --> 20:12.030
<b>What are you planning to do with Suletta?</b>

20:12.470 --> 20:14.100
<b>She's a good little girl, isn't she?</b>

20:14.100 --> 20:15.910
<b>This isn't funny!</b>

20:15.910 --> 20:18.460
<b>That girl will do
anything you tell her to!</b>

20:18.460 --> 20:21.150
<b>I won't let you have your way
with her anymore!</b>

20:22.110 --> 20:23.370
<b>And what then?</b>

20:23.370 --> 20:25.660
<b>Do you want to have your way
with her next?</b>

20:25.660 --> 20:26.980
<b>Just like your father...</b>

20:26.980 --> 20:29.520
<b>You're the one using her as a puppet!</b>

20:29.520 --> 20:31.030
<b>My lousy father has nothing
to do with this!</b>

20:31.030 --> 20:32.560
<b>Oh, but I'm afraid he does.</b>

20:32.560 --> 20:36.670
<b>Because your father is the object
of my family's vengeance.</b>

20:40.790 --> 20:44.040
<b>I guess that man Rajan
kept his mouth shut.</b>

20:44.040 --> 20:45.320
<b>Wait a second...</b>

20:45.320 --> 20:46.250
<b>What do you--</b>

20:46.250 --> 20:47.950
<b>I meant exactly what I said.</b>

20:48.960 --> 20:51.950
<b>During the Vanadis Incident 21 years ago,</b>

20:51.950 --> 20:56.530
<b>Delling Rembran deprived me
of my husband, my colleagues...</b>

20:56.530 --> 20:58.240
<b>and my mentor.</b>

20:58.760 --> 21:03.950
<b>In the name of "witch-hunting," that man
slaughtered everyone at the Institute.</b>

21:04.650 --> 21:07.200
<b>We're the only ones who survived.</b>

21:08.020 --> 21:08.960
<b>You're lying...</b>

21:09.560 --> 21:13.610
<b>You accused Suletta of being a murderer,</b>

21:13.610 --> 21:16.000
<b>but you're in the same position.</b>

21:16.740 --> 21:19.000
<b>Inside the circle of murderers...</b>

21:22.740 --> 21:25.010
<b>I want you to hear them too.</b>

21:25.500 --> 21:28.720
<b>The screams and cries of my comrades...</b>

21:29.250 --> 21:32.990
<b>"Avenge our deaths...
Kill that man Delling..."</b>

21:33.590 --> 21:36.870
<b>They're whispering it in my ear,
even as we speak.</b>

21:42.680 --> 21:45.570
<b>If you want revenge,
why don't you adults kill each other?</b>

21:46.030 --> 21:49.840
<b>But leave Suletta out of your vengeance!</b>

21:50.980 --> 21:53.300
<b>You're quite an admirable bride.</b>

21:53.300 --> 21:54.950
<b>Will you cooperate with me, then?</b>

21:55.350 --> 21:56.090
<b>Huh?</b>

21:56.570 --> 21:58.160
<b>Quiet Zero...</b>

21:58.620 --> 22:02.730
<b>At this rate, there'll be a new president,
and our plan will be ruined.</b>

22:03.330 --> 22:05.010
<b>That's why, Miorine Rembran...</b>

22:05.750 --> 22:08.430
<b>you must become the next president.</b>

22:08.910 --> 22:10.190
<b>Me?</b>

22:11.280 --> 22:12.900
<b>I could never...</b>

22:12.900 --> 22:14.220
<b>You can do it.</b>

22:14.800 --> 22:18.120
<b>After all, you're Delling Rembran's</b>

22:19.010 --> 22:21.450
<b>blood-stained daughter.</b>

23:53.920 --> 23:57.880
<b>Next time on
Mobile Suit Gundam the Witch from Mercury,</b>

23:53.920 --> 24:02.000
<b>Episode 17</b>

23:58.530 --> 23:59.760
<b>"Precious Things."</b>

24:02.000 --> 24:07.250
<b>Illustration: Kei Mochizuki</b>
